{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10231160","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10231160","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1023116001:1":{"text":"여러분! 줄리오는요? 그도 왔나요?","source_cn":"是你们！朱密欧呢？他也来了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24795C848E7EA4CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1023116002:1":{"text":"아니, 줄리오는 오지 못했어... 다쳤거든.","source_cn":"抱歉，他可能来不了——他受伤了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15CF70956E8ACF12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1023116003:1":{"text":"네? 다쳐요? 괜찮나요? 별일 없는 거죠?","source_cn":"什么？受伤了？！他还好吗？没有大碍吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03D6975BD879506D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1023116004:1":{"text":"당신의 아버지에게 쫓겨난 뒤에 고블린 둥지로 끌려들어 간 바람에...","source_cn":"那位可怜的先生，被你父亲拒绝后，又被咕布林拖进了巢穴……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DE590F523BE174D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1023116005:1":{"text":"뭐라고요?!","source_cn":"什么？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC31E78CBE8737231","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1023116006:1":{"text":"이봐 토끼 귀, 적당히 해. 지금은 안전하잖아.\n당신을 여기서 꺼내줄게. 그럼 두 사람은 함께할 수 있을 거야.","source_cn":"兔耳朵有点夸大其词，他现在已经脱离危险了。\\n我们正在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA271EBC6AD3E8F66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1023116007:1":{"text":"아, 불쌍한 줄리오...","source_cn":"哦，我可怜的朱密欧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC62469E98E14E07F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1023116008:1":{"text":"그럼 로리엣, 뒤로 물러나. 이 검으로 당신을 금방...","source_cn":"那么，罗丽叶小姐，请你后退几步，我手中的剑很快就会还你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25A33348FB6109D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1023116009:1":{"text":"...잠시만요!","source_cn":"——请等一下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A276CD1B445E11F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1023116010:1":{"text":"왜 그래?","source_cn":"怎么了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x017E66B46D51B81B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1023116011:1":{"text":"이렇게 소란을 피우면 아버지가 깨실 거예요. 보조 열쇠로 울타리를 열 수 있어요.","source_cn":"动静太大可能会吵醒我父亲……可以用备用钥匙打开这些栅栏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE46EEB9E34885068","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1023116011":{"text":"이렇게 소란을 피우면 아버지가 깨실 거예요. 보조 열쇠로 울타리를 열 수 있어요.","source_cn":"动静太大可能会吵醒我父亲……可以用备用钥匙打开这些栅栏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE46EEB9E34885068","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1023116012:1":{"text":"아버지는 항상 포도나무 받침대 아래에 열쇠를 숨겨두세요!","source_cn":"他把钥匙藏在了葡萄架下面！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6758B91B2B97066","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1023116013:1":{"text":"조금만 기다려, 금방 돌아오지.","source_cn":"交给我们吧，你在这里等着，我们会尽快回来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA47654F89963663D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1023116014:0":{"text":"고마워요, 좋은 소식 기다릴게요. 조심하세요!","source_cn":"谢谢你们，我等着你们的好消息，请万般小心！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDBF1F46F23B552E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:17:0:1":{"text":"보조 열쇠는 어디에 있어?","source_cn":"备用钥匙在哪里？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x88A7B3EB7FCB8E09","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"보조 열쇠는 어디에 있어?","female":"보조 열쇠는 어디에 있어?","variant_male_record_index":"59080","variant_female_record_index":"59081","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:罗丽叶":{"text":"로리엣","source":"罗丽叶","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维伦":{"text":"발렌","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":17,"localized_text_count":16,"speaker_count":3}}